WEBVTT

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.940
So, are you gonna wear a yukata when we go see the fireworks?

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:05.010
Aoharaido
Fireworks Display

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:05.900
No way.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.860
Putting one on is way too much effort.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.280
Yeah, I guess. They're hard to move in too.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:13.950
And the sandals hurt your feet. Not gonna happen.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.370
So true!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.900
I'd rather wear something I can move freely in.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.120
<i>I didn't...</i>

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.500
<i>I didn't lie.</i>

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.080
There we go! All done.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.360
Thanks.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.830
<i>Today's the day of the fireworks display.</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:47.950
<i>It's the first time this summer that I'm seeing Mabuchi!</i>

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.600
Your shirt is super cute.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.490
Really?

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:04.510
Maybe I should've worn something cuter too...

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.410
Futaba! Shuu!

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.380
Oh, here comes Yuuri.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.030
You two are here early.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.080
You're wearing a yukata today?

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:19.220
I thought you said you wouldn't wear one the other day.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.310
I never said I wouldn't wear one.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.180
Huh? Really?

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.160
So, are you gonna wear a yukata when we go see the fireworks?

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:27.090
No way. Putting one on is way too much effort.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:28.060
Yeah, I guess. They're hard to move in too.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:28.920
And the sandals hurt your feet. Not gonna happen.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:29.320
So true!

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.110
I'd rather wear something I can move freely in.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.900
Oh yeah, I guess you really didn't say that.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.290
But it's still kind of unfair to wear one.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:42.830
Yeah, but you went to Mabuchi's house
and followed him around and stuff, right?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.960
That's why I want to put in effort in my own way!

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:52.600
There they are!

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.590
Everybody's here already?

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.480
Long time no see, Murao.

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:01.050
Oh, you're wearing a yukata, Makita.

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:03.660
Yeah. Does it look weird?

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.890
Not at all. Looks perfectly fine.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:06.850
Really?!

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:10.160
I also tried styling my hair a bit today.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.400
It suits you. Looks nice.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.780
I'm glad you think so!

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:18.140
<i>She's really going in guns blazing from the get-go.</i>

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:21.740
Neither of you wants to lose.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:25.240
It this bothers you, it just means you have to try harder.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.210
Try harder?

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:29.940
I guess.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:52.050
<i>I decided to try my best today.</i>

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.440
Look at that! It's amazing!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:56.960
Where?

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.350
Over here!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.760
Look, Murao! They have a shooting game!

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.710
Which one do you want?

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.470
Hey, I'll play a round!

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.000
All right.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.220
I'll definitely win one for you, Murao!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:17.840
Mabuchi!

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.550
D-Do you want to eat some shaved ice?

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.650
That's it! Too bad, kiddo.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.530
One round, please.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.520
Huh?

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.580
Bullseye!

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.500
Here's the matcha and red bean shaved ice.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.390
Miss?

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:57.380
Oh, right.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.840
What flavor did you get?

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:00.960
Calpis.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.240
Lemme have a bite.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.940
Want some of mine?

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.090
What flavor is it?

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.680
Strawberry milk.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.310
<i>What are you, a couple?!</i>

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:13.630
Want some shaved ice, Shuuko?

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.320
What was that?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.650
I mean, Murao...

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:20.160
<i>We actually traded...</i>

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:25.850
<i>It's like we're really a couple!</i>

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.420
You want some too?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:35.300
Huh?

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:38.340
Oh, right. You don't like trading food.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.310
Sorry.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.710
<i>Dang it.</i>

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:47.600
<i>I'm glad I put in the effort to wear a yukata.</i>

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:54.520
Yuuri, watch out!

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.200
That was scary.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.070
Are you okay?

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.790
Yeah.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.330
You caught me, so I'm fine.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:15.830
What time do the fireworks start?

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.480
At seven, so pretty soon.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.080
I'm really looking forward to them!

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:22.760
Same.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:27.300
<i>He looks like he's really enjoying himself too.</i>

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.220
<i>I'm glad.</i>

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.030
<i>Even I...</i>

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.450
It's nothing!

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.260
You're an odd one.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:41.460
<i>...can get closer to him than Futaba if I try really hard.</i>

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:45.000
<i>I'll definitely surpass her.</i>

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:00.920
Excuse me.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.060
Yes?!

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:03.640
Touma?

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.840
Sorry! Just wait for me there!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:11.000
Anyway, there's something I need to talk to you about.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.740
Okay.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:17.990
Er, can we go talk over there?

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:19.850
Okay.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:30.390
<i>He seems really bothered by that.</i>

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:35.170
Please forget that ever happened.

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:35.910
Huh?

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:39.150
It was just an accident.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:41.640
That's all.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.020
That's impossible!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:46.070
There's no way I can just forget that!

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.380
I mean, that was...

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:49.430
my first time!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.560
No, what I'm saying is that I wanna forget all about—

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.960
What do you mean by that?

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:00.560
Huh?

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:04.450
How can you selfishly ask her to forget something like that?

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.040
What kind of man are you?

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.150
Wait, Kou!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.450
Do you think everything's all right?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.120
Well, I can't exactly see what's going on...

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.100
Are you shitting me?!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.330
You're such an idiot!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.080
And a pervert!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.460
My bad. I had the wrong idea.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:26.610
I'm really sorry.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.090
No, it's fine.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.550
I didn't think these situations happened in real life.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.640
What did you think you were doing?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.060
Damn, I really snapped.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.570
You're hilarious, dude.

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:41.180
Oh, shut up already.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.180
I really don't know what to say.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.410
It's fine.

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:47.770
I'm really sorry.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:54.160
How long are they gonna talk?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.080
Doesn't she hate guys?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.330
Idiot.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.930
I'm gonna go grab some food.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:05.320
Anyone want anything?

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:08.320
Some stir-fry noodles and a sausage for me!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.400
Same for me.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:11.800
Oh, get some for Yoshioka too.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:13.510
I'm coming with!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.060
Hey, where'd Yuuri and Kou go?

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.490
They went to get some food.

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:24.270
They went together?

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:28.480
Relax. I told them to get something for you too.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.470
That'll be 2,000 yen.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.530
<i>He seems to be in a bad mood for some reason.</i>

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:40.620
<i>Is it because Futaba was talking with that other guy?</i>

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:45.080
<i>Even though I'm trying my hardest to get closer to him...</i>

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:47.560
<i>It didn't amount to much.</i>

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.550
<i>Even though I wore this yukata...</i>

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.170
Ow!

00:08:52.480 --> 00:08:53.350
What's wrong?

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.320
Sorry.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.880
It's these sandals.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.510
Mind if I stop to put on a band-aid?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.590
You have one with you?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.680
Yeah, I always carry some.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.590
Girls are always so prepared.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:08.630
Oh, it's Kominato.

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:09.520
What's up?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:14.140
<i>Even if he sees me as a girl...</i>

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:18.120
<i>It's pointless if I can't charm him.</i>

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.660
Huh? I can't hear you.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.760
Anyway, Makita got hurt...

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.030
Actually, it's nothing. We'll be back soon.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:28.860
Bye.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.550
How's it going? You finished?

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.120
Sorry. Can you wait a little longer?

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.720
My sash is a bit tight.

00:09:36.190 --> 00:09:38.270
Give it here. I'll put it on for you.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:42.300
Sorry. It's all because I'm wearing this yukata.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.190
What're you on about?

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.940
This is the sorta thing you're supposed to wear one to.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:51.690
People who put them on for things like fireworks displays actually get it.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:58.150
<i>It seems like Mabuchi really does like Futaba.</i>

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:02.280
<i>I really tried my best. I wore a yukata.</i>

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:04.980
<i>I even did up my hair.</i>

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:09.900
<i>So why does he still prefer Futaba, who didn't put in any effort?</i>

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.710
How is it?

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.340
What? Does it hurt that much?

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:19.720
Should we look for a doctor?

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:22.850
<i>No matter how hard I try...</i>

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.070
<i>It might all be for naught.</i>

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:28.910
Makita.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:31.020
<i>But...</i>

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:34.800
<i>At this rate, if I don't tell him anything...</i>

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:40.530
<i>I'm sure one day I'll grow to resent Futaba and become a more despicable person.</i>

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.860
<i>So before that happens...</i>

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.370
Mabuchi.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.080
I like you.

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:54.860
<i>Before I come to hate myself, I want to tell him how I feel.</i>

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:00.390
I like you, Mabuchi.

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:05.660
Thanks.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:07.730
But...

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:11.970
I've never thought of you that way.

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:15.230
I'm sorry.

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:17.790
Sorry.

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:19.890
<i>I know.</i>

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.210
<i>I know that.</i>

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.850
Mabuchi, do you actually...

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.040
Yuuri!

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:36.120
Excuse me! Coming through!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.500
Sorry!

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.380
Yuuri! Yuuri!

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.170
Yuuri!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.140
Yuuri! Where are you hurt?!

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.350
Are you okay?!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.900
<i>She called my name again and again.</i>

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:54.440
<i>She came running to me despite the crowds.</i>

00:11:55.290 --> 00:12:00.220
<i>That alone makes me feel like everything's all okay.</i>

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.530
I'm fine, Futaba!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:09.260
<i>Once I get home, I'm going to cry my eyes out.</i>

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:16.630
<i>After that...</i>

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:20.710
<i>Yuuri and Kou spoke to each other like usual.</i>

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:25.850
<i>But Yuuri never again made it
a point to be right by Kou's side.</i>

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:35.490
I'm glad Yuuri only lost some skin.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:39.020
You shouldn't exaggerate like that.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.110
I was so worried back there.

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:46.160
An injury is an injury. Doesn't matter how bad.

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.680
You still could've explained it better!

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:50.080
Yeah, yeah.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:55.320
<i>I thought Yuuri might've said something to him.</i>

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.120
<i>But he's acting the same as always.</i>

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.660
<i>Damn, I can't tell.</i>

00:13:00.660 --> 00:13:04.220
<i>Did Yuuri confess or not?</i>

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:09.070
<i>When the time comes for me, will I be able to say it?</i>

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:13.650
<i>Could I actually say those three words to him?</i>

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:21.170
<i>What if I actually told him I liked him?</i>

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:24.920
<i>How would it feel?</i>

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.790
What the hell?

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.740
Another one?

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.380
This sure is taking a while.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.260
<i>He didn't notice.</i>

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.100
<i>How funny.</i>

00:13:58.140 --> 00:13:59.160
I love you.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:00.560
Huh?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.030
Did you say something?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.300
There's someone behind you.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:19.520
Oh... Sorry.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:20.440
Thanks.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:23.190
You need to pay more attention, idiot.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:28.380
<i>That really took me by surprise.</i>

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.880
<b>August 11th and 12th
Summer festival
in the cool of
the evening
Sakisaka Shrine</b>

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.100
Oh.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:45.190
It's the festival we couldn't go to.

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.230
Yeah.

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:53.010
I got so worked up back then about
whether or not we'd made a promise.

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:57.830
I've always wondered why I never made sure what you meant.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:01.910
7 o'clock. At the clock in Triangle Park.

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:03.840
Yeah, that was it.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:07.260
You didn't say anything else,
so I wasn't completely sure about what you meant.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.200
7 o'clock.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.970
At the clock in Triangle Park.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.820
My beard doesn't get what you mean.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:33.530
I was trying to ask you again just now.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:35.790
Let's actually go this time.

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:42.190
But both Yuuri and Shuuko are going to be busy with family stuff then.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.560
And I'm pretty sure Kominato's busy too.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.000
I know.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:50.210
Do you mean we should go by ourselves?

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.180
If you don't want to, that's fine.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.700
I'll go! I want to go!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.270
Then say that from the start, idiot.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.560
Right.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.560
<i>What do I do?!</i>

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.890
<i>I'm so frickin' happy right now!</i>

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.790
<i>I want to scream!</i>

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:10.080
<i>We're going to the festival by ourselves!</i>

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.890
Maybe I should wear a yukata.

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.410
I mean, since I didn't get to today.

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.870
Won't it just make you look like a sumo wrestler?

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.540
Hey, that's mean!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.200
Apologize!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.280
Ouch!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:26.000
Don't kick me with your front hooves, Ms. Piggy!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.750
Front hooves?! What's that supposed to mean?!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:36.680
<i>His smile seems a little different than before.</i>

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:40.000
<i>If he shows me that smile,</i>

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.390
<i>I might end up forgetting I'm mad at him.</i>

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.540
Wear it.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.320
I'd like to see you in a yukata.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.920
<i>My heart skipped a beat.</i>

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:02.170
Well, my place is this way.

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.760
Wait, you obviously already know that.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.460
Yeah...

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.510
Well, bye.

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:18.470
Wait!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:22.690
Can't you stay a little longer?

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:28.350
Why?

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:33.650
I don't feel like going home yet.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:38.480
<i>Wait, what am I saying?!</i>

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.540
I mean, isn't this exciting?

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:48.410
Didn't I tell you not to let your guard down around men?

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:52.160
You never know what might happen.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:18:01.550
But you won't do anything, right?

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:06.390
You can't be sure,

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.950
even if it's me.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.900
If it's you,

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:17.080
I just might not...

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.910
be afraid.

00:18:37.810 --> 00:18:39.090
This isn't good.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:41.600
This is a slippery slope.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.530
I'll walk you home.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.480
Let's go.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.590
<i>I can't...</i>

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.740
<i>believe I just did something so bold!</i>

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.790
<i>Maybe it's the effects of a summer's night.</i>

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:04.630
Thanks for walking me home.

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:06.030
Yeah.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:07.590
Bye.

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:11.230
Hey.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:15.550
What did you say back there at the railroad crossing?

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.510
Huh? Dunno...

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:22.490
All right, then.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.420
<i>I won't say it now.</i>

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:28.760
See ya.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.810
Yeah, see you at the festival!

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:48.500
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:51.370
<i>We're getting closer.</i>

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:59.340
<i>Did being just an inch apart in both our words and actions always feel so heart-poundingly intense yet pleasant?</i>

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:09.190
Mom, get out my yukata!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:16.580
<i>On the day of the festival,
I want to wear my yukata, do my hair,</i>

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:20.390
<i>and tell Kou I love him!</i>

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:29.070
Huh?

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:30.190
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:32.830
<i>I can't go to the festival.</i>

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.630
<i>I'm really sorry.</i>

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:36.990
I see...

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.470
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.220
Did something happen?

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.450
I'll tell you when Yuuri gets here.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.380
Speak of the devil.

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:56.680
Futaba, Shuu, I missed you so much!

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.100
Welcome back!

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.160
Welcome back.

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:01.550
It's good to be back.

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:03.240
How was your trip?

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.270
It was so much fun!

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:07.790
Must've been nice.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:17.390
<i>Our summer vacation may have ended like this.</i>

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:21.450
<i>But I'll face what lies ahead...</i>

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.760
<i>Little by little.</i>

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:27.680
<i>Page by page.</i>

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:34.690
<i>We'll take it one page at a time,
thinking and feeling our way through.</i>

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:46.040
All right! Today the donuts are on me!

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.890
Shuu!
Shuuko!

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:50.910
It's too hot outside.
